:: Millers Babysitting Twin Bedroom Play Wrestle [nobr]

/* Intro */
Sitting almost perfectly in the center of the bedroom between the two beds, though with his back to his own, you spot <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kayden</span> playing with a handful of wrestling figures and a small ring. He seems to have a lot of those figures, but is currently only using two in what appears to be a heated match. <br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Happy",
            },
        },
        {
            Name: "OC Kayden",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Everyday",
                Mouth: "Happy",
            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kayden</span> sees you as you take a seat next to him and smiles, before returning to his match as one superstar suplexes the other with dramatic sound effects provided by the cute boy. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“One! Two! Three!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kayden</span> counts the pin, bouncing up and down with his bottom as his hands are occupied. He then lifts up the victor and cheers, mimicking the crowd noises. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Hey, wanna play with me? It’s much easier with more than two hands!”</span> <span style="Color: LightGreen">You laugh and nod, agreeing to have a match with the boy.</span>  <br>
<br>

<<linkreplace "Continue">>

    <<set _random to random(1, 3)>>
        <<if _random == 1>>

        <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kayden</span> smiles happily as you agree to his match and gets on his knees and turns around to the pile of figures to search for one. <span style="Color: Pink">You watch as his little butt sways back and forth as he searches before he turns back around with a very impressive looking figure with a golden belt around its waist.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“It’s a championship match! This guy’s the champion and everyone is trying to beat him so they can win the belt. But he always wins, because he’s my favorite and he’s super good!”</span> <br>
        <br>
        You laugh and ask <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kayden</span> if he wants you to pick someone to take him on, but <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kayden</span> shakes his head. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Nah, let’s make it a tag team! That way we can beat up people together and neither of us have to be the loser! Plus, we can win the tag belts too!”</span> You smile and agree, though pointing out that you both could still technically lose, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“No way! We’re way too good to lose!”</span> You spend the next few minutes going through and picking yourself a wrestler, getting details about their history and lore from <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kayden</span>. Once you’ve made your decision, the two of you work together to come up with an intense and detailed story of a feud that is finally coming to an end in this match, which is somehow the two of you verses every single <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“bad guy”</span> wrestler <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kayden</span> has. <br>
        <br>

        <div id=choice>
            <<link "Let Kayden take the lead<br>">>
            <<replace"#choice">>

            You let <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kayden</span> take the lead with the story, watching as he adorably sings the theme songs of the wrestlers as they come out and even shows off some of their poses. Though you are pretty sure he is just making some of the motions up, <span style="Color: Pink">especially the ones where he shoved his butt in your face and wiggled it and the one where he attempted to do a handstand but lost his balance and fell on top of you.</span> <br>
            <br>
            It is a very fun time and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kayden</span> can’t seem to stop smiling. From telling an epic story, to some epic tag-team moves, to <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kayden</span> recreating some of the moves too complex for the action figures to do on his stuffed animals. <span style="Color: LightGreen">You can’t help but smile as you watch the energetic little boy jump and flail about as you play. In the end, the two of you share a victory pose and perform a bad but wholesome rendition of your theme songs.</span> <br>
            <<socialChange "Kayden" 3 1>>
            <<needChange "Fun" 5>>
            <span style="color:green">+Kayden Fun</span><br>
            <<set $HangOutNeed.Fun += 10>>
            <span style="color:green">+Kayden Comfort</span><br>
            <<set $HangOutNeed.Comfort += 5>>
            <span style="color:red">-Kayden Energy</span><br>
            <<set $HangOutNeed.Energy -= 5>>
            <br>
            [[Continue|OC Miller House Twins Room]] 

            <</replace>>
            <</link>>

            <<link "Turn on him after winning<br>">>
            <<replace"#choice">>

            As <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kayden</span> jumps and dances about, singing the theme songs of the wrestles that come in, <span style="Color: Pink">you can’t get your eyes off the peeks at his vulnerable little sides as his shirt flops about.</span> You smile as an idea forms in your head, one that will make this match end with something much more interesting than a simple victory. Well, at least for you. <br>
            <br>
            The match lasts about half an hour, with so many wrestlers in the ring and you both having to eliminate them one by one over the top rope. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kayden</span> giggles every time you add dramatic commentary or accidentally knock over the wrong wrestler. As the match is about to come to an end, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kayden</span> does an epic move, or at least describes one and tries his best to recreate it with the toys, and the two of you gain victory! <br> 
            <br>
            <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“We’re unstoppable!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kayden</span> declares, holding up the figures as your team wins the belts! The time is right, you reach out and grab <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kayden</span>, yanking him onto his bed as the boy drops his toys in confusion. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Wha-!?”</span> <span style="Color: LightGreen">He cries out as you slip your hands under his shirt, right on those little sides of his, and declare that it is time for the champion to get humbled! You’ve been against him this whole time and it is now your turn to act! <br>

            <<set _ad to [
                {
                    Name: "Player",
                    State: {
                        Mouth: "Smirk",
                        Eyes: "Mad",
                    },
                },
                {
                    Name: "OC Kayden",
                    State: {
                        Outfit: "Everyday",
                        Mouth: "Happy",
                        Eyes: "Closed",
                        Blush: 3,
                        Cry: 1,
                    },
                },
            ]>>
            <<ad _ad>>

        You proceed to tickle the boy relentlessly. He is unable to resist, becoming a giggling mess as he tries to free himself but is helpless against your fingers. It doesn’t take long for the boy to become a crying, red-faced mess as he smacks his bed and yells about <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“tapping out”</span>. You take that as your victory and stand over the exhausted boy holding your belts up high.</span> <br>
        <<socialChange "Kayden" 3 1>>
