        <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“You think the Masked Menace if going to try taking my title?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kayden</span> narrates as both toys stand in the plastic wrestling ring, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“There is no way!”</span> As the fight begins, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kayden</span> narrates the match and describes his moves, giggling as he does so. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Jobs dodges the Menace’s punch and – Boom! – A suplex!”</span> You laugh along, responding with your own narration. <br>
        <br>

