            <<replace"#choice3">>
            You send your wrestler to the top rope for a flying elbow drop! Wham! It hits Jobs directly and he falls to the ground! <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kayden</span> laughs so hard at this he falls backwards. You take this chance to try to pin Jobs, One, Two-! No! Only a two! <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kayden</span> manages to get up and kick out just in time! <br>
            <br>
            As the match goes on, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kayden</span>’s referee figure counts many close calls until Powerhouse Jobs manages to win with his finishing move, the Powerhouse Slam! <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kayden</span> throws his arms up in victory, proudly declaring his wrestler unbeatable. <span style="Color: LightGreen">You talk as your character as you exit the ring, promising to come back for a rematch soon and taking that title!</span> <br>
